  files:   system-prompt --agent A | skills --agent A | platform-skills
           org | memory --agent A --user U
  set:     reads the new text from --file <path> (or stdin)
  version: <id> shows an old version; revert <id> makes it current again
  example: sudo agenti admin context show system-prompt --agent enum" ;;
                *) die "unknown context verb '$cverb' — show|set|reset|history|version|revert" ;;
